    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/f45334c5bd32cce06e2a283dbec93f89.avif?t=1726296561\" width=616 height=120 /></span><br>In &quot;<strong>Star Conqueror</strong>,&quot; you take on the role of a space commander, forging alliances with 10+ factions to build and lead your interstellar fleet against the Andromeda invasion. Customize your starships, engage in real-time battles, and partake in governance decisions and trade. Collaborate or compete with other players to script your own interstellar legend.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build The Interstellar Fleet Of Your Dreams</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/544b43d6ae7b036ec1e04559f93c65a6.poster.avif?t=1726296561\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/544b43d6ae7b036ec1e04559f93c65a6.webm?t=1726296561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/544b43d6ae7b036ec1e04559f93c65a6.mp4?t=1726296561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u25a0 10+ unique factions, each with charismatic leaders and distinctive traits.<br>\u25a0 Over 100 base components and faction-specific modules for you to freely mix and match.<br>\u25a0 Long-term balance support ensures that customizing your starships is filled with strategy and enjoyment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer In grand and Epic Space Battles</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/c78848c8dfcc7bd6f8787a35bb6d65b7.poster.avif?t=1726296561\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/c78848c8dfcc7bd6f8787a35bb6d65b7.webm?t=1726296561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/c78848c8dfcc7bd6f8787a35bb6d65b7.mp4?t=1726296561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u25a0 Vast battlefield accommodating the clash of 200+ warships.<br>\u25a0 Utilize over 20 decisive weapons to turn the table or set the victory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-time Tactical PvP &amp; Multiplayer</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/e21c4a20ed3524ab2f5b45f864d9a236.poster.avif?t=1726296561\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/e21c4a20ed3524ab2f5b45f864d9a236.webm?t=1726296561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/e21c4a20ed3524ab2f5b45f864d9a236.mp4?t=1726296561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u25a0 Establish or join interstellar guilds, conquer space together with friends.<br>\u25a0 4 types of battle modes and 1 interstellar battlefield, win honor and resources for your fleet.<br>\u25a0 Of course, there's also plenty of intense PVE combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Script Your Legend Within The Theatrical Narrative</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/b757a716e6da3c11753c66f86aa96923.poster.avif?t=1726296561\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/b757a716e6da3c11753c66f86aa96923.webm?t=1726296561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913500/extras/b757a716e6da3c11753c66f86aa96923.mp4?t=1726296561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u25a0 With nearly a million words of storytelling, experience a vast and tumultuous galaxy<br>\u25a0 Governance decision-making, trade building... Bringing you the commander experience beyond battles.<br>\u25a0 eXplore, eXpand, eXploit and eXterminate, triggering more interconnected stories, delving into mysterious depths, and crafting your own legend.<br><br><br>The following languages have been translated and proofread.<br>English \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587<br>The following languages are still in the testing phase.<br>Fran\u00e7ais  Espa\u00f1ol - Espa\u00f1a  Portugu\u00eas - Brasil  Deutsch  \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439 \u044f\u0437\u044b\u043a  \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e  \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587  \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4  Italiano  Portugu\u00eas - Portugal  Polski  \u010ce\u0161tina  Espa\u00f1ol - Am\u00e9rica Latina  T\u00fcrk\u00e7e  \u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22",
